{"resourceType":"Bundle","id":"343962dc-01f0-4144-8d49-0466c74561bd","meta":{"versionId":"1","lastUpdated":"2024-04-30T08:02:23.702+00:00"},"identifier":{"system":"http://ema.europa.eu/fhir/epiDocument","value":"6fc2deb3-4f42-ee11-bdf5-000d3aaa033a"},"type":"document","timestamp":"2024-04-16T09:11:43.5783682+00:00","entry":[{"fullUrl":"http://ema.europa.eu/fhir","resource":{"resourceType":0,"language":25,"text":{"status":"generated","div":"<div xmlns =\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">electronic Product Information (ePI) document</div>"},"status":0,"type":{"coding":[{"system":"https://spor.ema.europa.eu/v1/lists/100000155531/terms/","code":"100000155538","display":"Package Leaflet (Swedish)"}]},"date":"2024-04-16","author":[{"identifier":{"system":"http://www.test.com","value":"systemuser"}}],"title":"Provera","section":[{"id":"a5c2deb3-4f42-ee11-bdf5-000d3aaa033a","title":"BIPACKSEDEL","text":{"status":"generated","div":"<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Bipacksedel: Information till anv&#228;ndaren</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; break-after: avoid; margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">&#160;</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; break-after: avoid; margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Provera 5 mg tabletter </span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; break-after: avoid; margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Provera 10 mg tabletter </span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">&#160;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">medroxiprogesteronacetat</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">&#160;</span></em></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm -0.1pt 0cm 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">L&#228;s noga igenom denna bipacksedel innan du b&#246;rjar anv&#228;nda detta l&#228;kemedel. </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Den inneh&#229;ller information som &#228;r viktig f&#246;r dig.</span></strong></p>\n<ol style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">\n<li style=\"margin: 0cm -0.1pt 0.0001pt 0px; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Spara denna information, du kan beh&#246;va l&#228;sa den igen.</span></li>\n<li style=\"margin: 0cm -0.1pt 0.0001pt 0px; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Om du har ytterligare fr&#229;gor v&#228;nd dig till l&#228;kare eller apotekspersonal.</span></li>\n<li style=\"margin: 0cm -0.1pt 0.0001pt 0px; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Detta l&#228;kemedel har ordinerats enbart &#229;t dig. Ge det inte till andra. Det kan skada dem, &#228;ven om de uppvisar sjukdomstecken som liknar dina.</span></li>\n<li style=\"margin: 0cm -0.1pt 0.0001pt 0px; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Om du f&#229;r biverkningar, tala med l&#228;kare, apotekspersonal eller sjuksk&#246;terska.</span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; color: red;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Detta g&#228;ller<span style=\"color: red;\"> </span>&#228;ven<span style=\"color: red;\"> </span>eventuella biverkningar som inte n&#228;mns i denna information. Se avsnitt 4.</span></li>\n</ol>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm -0.1pt 0cm 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">&#160;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm -0.1pt 0cm 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">I denna bipacksedel finns information om f&#246;ljande</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">:</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm -1.45pt 0.0001pt 1cm; text-indent: -1cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">1.&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160; Vad Provera &#228;r och vad det anv&#228;nds f&#246;r</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm -1.45pt 0.0001pt 1cm; text-indent: -1cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">2.&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160; Vad du beh&#246;ver veta innan du anv&#228;nder Provera</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\"> </span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm -1.45pt 0.0001pt 1cm; text-indent: -1cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">3.&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160; Hur du anv&#228;nder Provera</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm -1.45pt 0.0001pt 1cm; text-indent: -1cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">4.&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160; Eventuella biverkningar</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm -1.45pt 0.0001pt 1cm; text-indent: -1cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">5.&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160; Hur Provera ska f&#246;rvaras</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm -1.45pt 0.0001pt 1cm; text-indent: -1cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">6.&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160; F&#246;rpackningens inneh&#229;ll och &#246;vriga upplysningar</span></p></div>"},"section":[{"id":"b2c2deb3-4f42-ee11-bdf5-000d3aaa033a","title":"1. Vad Provera är och vad det används för","text":{"status":"generated","div":"<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Provera inneh&#229;ller medroxiprogesteronacetat. Medroxiprogesteronacetat &#228;r ett syntetiskt hormon som liknar det naturligt f&#246;rekommande hormonet progesteron som bildas i &#228;ggstocken under den normala menstruationscykelns andra h&#228;lft.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">&#160;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">L&#229;ga doser Provera anv&#228;nds f&#246;r att behandla menstruationsrubbningar och &#228;ven f&#246;r behandling av klimakteriebesv&#228;r.</span></p>\n<p style=\"break-after: avoid; margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">&#160;</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Medroxiprogesteronacetat <span style=\"color: black;\">som finns i Provera kan ocks&#229; vara godk&#228;nd f&#246;r att behandla andra sjukdomar som inte n&#228;mns i denna bipacksedel. Fr&#229;ga l&#228;kare, apotekspersonal eller annan h&#228;lso- och sjukv&#229;rdspersonal om du har ytterligare fr&#229;gor och f&#246;lj alltid deras instruktion.</span></span></p></div>"},"code":{"coding":[{"system":"https://spor.ema.europa.eu/v1/lists/200000029659/terms/","code":"200000029895","display":"1. Vad Provera är och vad det används för"}]}},{"id":"b7c2deb3-4f42-ee11-bdf5-000d3aaa033a","title":"2. Vad du behöver veta innan du använder Provera","text":{"status":"generated","div":"<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">&#160;</div>"},"section":[{"id":"bfc2deb3-4f42-ee11-bdf5-000d3aaa033a","title":"Använd inte Provera","text":{"status":"generated","div":"<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; margin-top: 0px;\">\n<li style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">om du &#228;r allergisk mot </span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">medroxiprogesteronacetat eller n&#229;got annat inneh&#229;lls&#228;mne i detta l&#228;kemedel (anges i avsnitt 6).</span></li>\n</ul></div>"},"code":{"coding":[{"system":"https://spor.ema.europa.eu/v1/lists/200000029659/terms/","code":"200000029897","display":"Använd inte Provera"}]}},{"id":"17c3deb3-4f42-ee11-bdf5-000d3aaa033a","title":"Varningar och försiktighet","text":{"status":"generated","div":"<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Tala med l&#228;kare eller apotekspersonal innan du anv&#228;nder Provera om du lider av f&#246;ljande:</span></p>\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; margin-top: 0px;\">\n<li style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">porfyri.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">&#160;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Om bl&#246;dningar upptr&#228;der vid annan tidpunkt &#228;n den avsedda ska du kontakta behandlande l&#228;kare och &#228;ven om du f&#229;r kraftig huvudv&#228;rk eller synst&#246;rning.</span></p></div>"},"code":{"coding":[{"system":"https://spor.ema.europa.eu/v1/lists/200000029659/terms/","code":"200000029898","display":"Varningar och försiktighet"}]}},{"id":"6bc3deb3-4f42-ee11-bdf5-000d3aaa033a","title":"Andra läkemedel och Provera","text":{"status":"generated","div":"<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Tala om f&#246;r l&#228;kare eller apotekspersonal om du anv&#228;nder, nyligen har anv&#228;nt eller kan t&#228;nkas anv&#228;nda andra l&#228;kemedel.</span></p></div>"},"code":{"coding":[{"system":"https://spor.ema.europa.eu/v1/lists/200000029659/terms/","code":"200000029900","display":"Andra läkemedel och Provera"}]}},{"id":"b1c3deb3-4f42-ee11-bdf5-000d3aaa033a","title":"Graviditet, amning och fertilitet","text":{"status":"generated","div":"<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Om du &#228;r gravid eller ammar, tror att du kan vara gravid eller planerar att skaffa barn, r&#229;dfr&#229;ga l&#228;kare eller apotekspersonal innan du anv&#228;nder detta l&#228;kemedel.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">&#160;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Provera ska ej anv&#228;ndas under graviditet.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">&#160;</span></p>\n<p style=\"break-after: avoid; margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Provera passerar &#246;ver i br&#246;stmj&#246;lk men p&#229;verkar troligen inte barn som ammas. R&#229;dg&#246;r dock med l&#228;kare vid mer &#228;n tillf&#228;lligt bruk av Provera under amning.</span></p>\n<p style=\"break-after: avoid; margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">&#160;</p>\n<p style=\"break-after: avoid; margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Provera kan h&#228;mma &#228;gglossning.</span></p></div>"},"code":{"coding":[{"system":"https://spor.ema.europa.eu/v1/lists/200000029659/terms/","code":"200000029902","display":"Graviditet, amning och fertilitet"}]}},{"id":"c9c3deb3-4f42-ee11-bdf5-000d3aaa033a","title":"Körförmåga och användning av maskiner","text":{"status":"generated","div":"<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p style=\"break-after: avoid; margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Provera har ingen eller obetydlig p&#229;verkan p&#229; f&#246;rm&#229;gan att k&#246;ra bil eller utf&#246;ra precisionsarbete.</span></p>\n<p style=\"break-after: avoid; margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">&#160;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Du &#228;r sj&#228;lv ansvarig f&#246;r att bed&#246;ma om du &#228;r i kondition att framf&#246;ra motorfordon eller utf&#246;ra arbete som kr&#228;ver sk&#228;rpt vaksamhet. En av faktorerna som kan p&#229;verka din f&#246;rm&#229;ga i dessa avseenden &#228;r anv&#228;ndning av l&#228;kemedel p&#229; grund av deras effekter och/eller biverkningar. Beskrivning av dessa effekter och biverkningar finns i andra avsnitt. L&#228;s d&#228;rf&#246;r all information i denna bipacksedel f&#246;r v&#228;gledning. Diskutera med din l&#228;kare eller apotekspersonal om du &#228;r os&#228;ker.</span></p></div>"},"code":{"coding":[{"system":"https://spor.ema.europa.eu/v1/lists/200000029659/terms/","code":"200000029903","display":"Körförmåga och användning av maskiner"}]}},{"id":"ddc3deb3-4f42-ee11-bdf5-000d3aaa033a","title":"Provera innehåller laktos och sackaros","text":{"status":"generated","div":"<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p style=\"break-after: avoid; margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Om du inte t&#229;l vissa sockerarter, b&#246;r du kontakta din l&#228;kare innan du tar detta l&#228;kemedel.</span></p></div>"},"code":{"coding":[{"system":"https://spor.ema.europa.eu/v1/lists/200000029659/terms/","code":"200000029904","display":"Provera innehåller laktos och sackaros"}]}}],"code":{"coding":[{"system":"https://spor.ema.europa.eu/v1/lists/200000029659/terms/","code":"200000029896","display":"2. Vad du behöver veta innan du använder Provera"}]}},{"id":"eac3deb3-4f42-ee11-bdf5-000d3aaa033a","title":"3. Hur du använder Provera","text":{"status":"generated","div":"<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Anv&#228;nd alltid detta l&#228;kemedel enligt l&#228;karens eller apotekspersonalens anvisningar. R&#229;dfr&#229;ga l&#228;kare eller apotekspersonal om du &#228;r os&#228;ker.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">&#160;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Dosen best&#228;ms av l&#228;kare som avpassar den individuellt f&#246;r dig.</span></p></div>"},"section":[{"id":"fec3deb3-4f42-ee11-bdf5-000d3aaa033a","title":"Om du använt för stor mängd av Provera","text":{"status":"generated","div":"<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p style=\"margin: 0cm; break-after: avoid; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Om du f&#229;tt i dig f&#246;r stor m&#228;ngd l&#228;kemedel eller om t.ex. ett barn f&#229;tt i sig l&#228;kemedlet av misstag kontakta alltid l&#228;kare, sjukhus eller Giftinformationscentralen (tel. 112) f&#246;r bed&#246;mning av risken samt r&#229;dgivning.</span></p></div>"},"code":{"coding":[{"system":"https://spor.ema.europa.eu/v1/lists/200000029659/terms/","code":"200000029907","display":"Om du använt för stor mängd av Provera"}]}},{"id":"00c4deb3-4f42-ee11-bdf5-000d3aaa033a","title":"Om du har glömt att använda Provera","text":{"status":"generated","div":"<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p style=\"margin: 0cm -0.1pt 0cm 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Ta inte dubbel dos f&#246;r att kompensera f&#246;r gl&#246;md tablett.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm -0.1pt 0cm 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">&#160;</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm -0.1pt 0cm 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">Om du har ytterligare fr&#229;gor om detta l&#228;kemedel, kontakta l&#228;kare eller apotekspersonal.</span></span></p></div>"},"code":{"coding":[{"system":"https://spor.ema.europa.eu/v1/lists/200000029659/terms/","code":"200000029908","display":"Om du har glömt att använda Provera"}]}}],"code":{"coding":[{"system":"https://spor.ema.europa.eu/v1/lists/200000029659/terms/","code":"200000029905","display":"3. Hur du använder Provera"}]}},{"id":"07c4deb3-4f42-ee11-bdf5-000d3aaa033a","title":"4. Eventuella biverkningar","text":{"status":"generated","div":"<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p style=\"margin: 0cm -1.45pt 0cm 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Liksom alla l&#228;kemedel kan detta l&#228;kemedel orsaka biverkningar, men alla anv&#228;ndare beh&#246;ver inte f&#229; dem.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; break-after: avoid; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">&#160;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Vanliga (kan f&#246;rekomma hos upp till 1 av 10 anv&#228;ndare)</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">: Vikt&#246;kning, nedst&#228;mdhet, huvudv&#228;rk, br&#246;stsp&#228;nningar, illam&#229;ende, oregelbunden bl&#246;dning, sm&#228;rtsamma menstruationer, v&#228;tskeansamling i kroppen.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">&#160;</span></em></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Mindre vanliga (kan f&#246;rekomma hos upp till 1 av 100 anv&#228;ndare)</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">: </span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Minskad sexuell lust, akne, h&#229;ravfall, p&#229;verkan p&#229; leverfunktionen.</span></p></div>"},"section":[{"id":"13c4deb3-4f42-ee11-bdf5-000d3aaa033a","title":"Rapportering av biverkningar","text":{"status":"generated","div":"<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p style=\"margin: 0cm -0.1pt 0cm 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; color: black;\">Om du f&#229;r biverkningar, tala med l&#228;kare, apotekspersonal eller sjuksk&#246;terska. Detta g&#228;ller &#228;ven biverkningar som inte n&#228;mns i denna information. Du kan ocks&#229; rapportera biverkningar direkt (se detaljer nedan). Genom att rapportera biverkningar kan du bidra till att &#246;ka informationen om l&#228;kemedels s&#228;kerhet.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm -0.1pt 0cm 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; color: black;\">&#160;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm -0.1pt 0cm 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; color: black;\">L&#228;kemedelsverket </span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm -0.1pt 0cm 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; color: black;\">Box 26 </span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm -0.1pt 0cm 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; color: black;\">751 03 Uppsala</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm -0.1pt 0cm 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; color: black;\">Webbplats: </span><a href=\"http://www.lakemedelsverket.se\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">www.lakemedelsverket.se</span></a></p></div>"},"code":{"coding":[{"system":"https://spor.ema.europa.eu/v1/lists/200000029659/terms/","code":"200000029912","display":"Rapportering av biverkningar"}]}}],"code":{"coding":[{"system":"https://spor.ema.europa.eu/v1/lists/200000029659/terms/","code":"200000029910","display":"4. Eventuella biverkningar"}]}},{"id":"19c4deb3-4f42-ee11-bdf5-000d3aaa033a","title":"5. Hur Provera ska förvaras","text":{"status":"generated","div":"<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">F&#246;rvara detta l&#228;kemedel</span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\"> utom syn- och r&#228;ckh&#229;ll f&#246;r barn.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm -0.1pt 0cm 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">&#160;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm -0.1pt 0cm 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Anv&#228;nds f&#246;re utg&#229;ngsdatum som anges p&#229; kartongen efter EXP. Utg&#229;ngsdatumet &#228;r den sista dagen i angiven m&#229;nad.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm -0.1pt 0cm 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">&#160;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm -0.1pt 0cm 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">L&#228;kemedel ska inte kastas i avloppet eller bland hush&#229;llsavfall. Fr&#229;ga apotekspersonalen hur man kastar l&#228;kemedel som inte l&#228;ngre anv&#228;nds. Dessa &#229;tg&#228;rder &#228;r till f&#246;r att skydda milj&#246;n.</span></p></div>"},"code":{"coding":[{"system":"https://spor.ema.europa.eu/v1/lists/200000029659/terms/","code":"200000029913","display":"5. Hur Provera ska förvaras"}]}},{"id":"24c4deb3-4f42-ee11-bdf5-000d3aaa033a","title":"6. Förpackningens innehåll och övriga upplysningar","text":{"status":"generated","div":"<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">&#160;</div>"},"section":[{"id":"2ac4deb3-4f42-ee11-bdf5-000d3aaa033a","title":"Innehållsdeklaration","text":{"status":"generated","div":"<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><ul style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">\n<li style=\"margin: 0cm -0.1pt 0.0001pt 0px; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Den aktiva substansen &#228;r medroxiprogesteronacetat. En tablett inneh&#229;ller 5 mg eller 10&#160;mg medroxiprogesteronacetat.</span></li>\n<li style=\"margin: 0cm -0.1pt 0.0001pt 0px; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">&#214;vriga inneh&#229;lls&#228;mnen &#228;r laktosmonohydrat 84,2 mg resp. 110 mg, majsst&#228;rkelse, talk, sackaros 1,47 mg resp. 2 mg, flytande paraffin och kalciumstearat. <br />Enbart tabletter 5 mg: indigokarmin (f&#228;rg&#228;mne E132).</span></li>\n</ul></div>"},"code":{"coding":[{"system":"https://spor.ema.europa.eu/v1/lists/200000029659/terms/","code":"200000029915","display":"Innehållsdeklaration"}]}},{"id":"32c4deb3-4f42-ee11-bdf5-000d3aaa033a","title":"Läkemedlets utseende och förpackningsstorlekar","text":{"status":"generated","div":"<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Utseende</span></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">5 mg tabletter:</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\"> runda, bl&#229;, sk&#229;rade, diameter 6,4 mm, m&#228;rkta U p&#229; den ena sidan och 286 p&#229; b&#229;da sidor om en brytsk&#229;ra p&#229; den andra sidan.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">&#160;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">10 mg tabletter</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">: runda, vita, sk&#229;rade, diameter 7,1 mm, m&#228;rkta UPJOHN 50.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">&#160;</span></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">F&#246;rpackningsstorlekar</span></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Tryckf&#246;rpackning, 5 mg tabletter&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160; 40 st, 100 st</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Tryckf&#246;rpackning, 10 mg tabletter&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160; 10 st, 40 st, 100 st</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 35pt; text-indent: -35pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">&#160;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 35pt; text-indent: -35pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Eventuellt kommer inte alla f&#246;rpackningsstorlekar och styrkor att marknadsf&#246;ras. </span></p></div>"},"code":{"coding":[{"system":"https://spor.ema.europa.eu/v1/lists/200000029659/terms/","code":"200000029916","display":"Läkemedlets utseende och förpackningsstorlekar"}]}},{"id":"38c4deb3-4f42-ee11-bdf5-000d3aaa033a","title":"Innehavare av godkännande för försäljning","text":{"status":"generated","div":"<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p style=\"margin: 0cm 155.85pt 0cm 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Pfizer AB&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160; </span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 155.85pt 0cm 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">113 63 Stockholm</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Telefon: 08-550&#160;520 00</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">E-mail: medical.information@pfizer.com</span></p></div>"},"code":{"coding":[{"system":"https://spor.ema.europa.eu/v1/lists/200000029659/terms/","code":"200000029917","display":"Innehavare av godkännande för försäljning"}]}},{"id":"49c4deb3-4f42-ee11-bdf5-000d3aaa033a","title":"Denna bipacksedel ändrades senast","text":{"status":"generated","div":"<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p>2024-04-16</p></div>"},"code":{"coding":[{"system":"https://spor.ema.europa.eu/v1/lists/200000029659/terms/","code":"200000029919","display":"Denna bipacksedel ändrades senast"}]}}],"code":{"coding":[{"system":"https://spor.ema.europa.eu/v1/lists/200000029659/terms/","code":"200000029914","display":"6. Förpackningens innehåll och övriga upplysningar"}]}}],"code":{"coding":[{"system":"https://spor.ema.europa.eu/v1/lists/200000029659/terms/","code":"200000029894","display":"BIPACKSEDEL"}]}}]}}]}